{
	"name": "onco-therapy-pipeline",
	"version": "0.1.0",
	"description": "Systems-level knowledge base for the end-to-end personalized cancer-therapy pipeline across both design branches — immune (neoantigen mRNA vaccines, CAR-T/TCR-T/TIL, BiTE/ICI) and genetic (oncolytic virus, CRISPR/base/prime, ASO/siRNA). Holds the whole process as one evolving map (sampling → diff → design → manufacture → delivery → efficacy), makes the walls and modality landscape first-class, and marks every claim computable vs empirical with graded provenance. The binding constraint is delivery into the solid tumor.",
